SUMMARY:Thursday Night Comedy Show with Friends!  (Absolute Comedy) (Yonge
  and Eglinton)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*Please kindly read carefully-thank you\\***\n\nJoin us for a fantasti
 c and hilarious evening of mix\, mingling\, reserved seating and of course
  a super fun comedy show at **Absolute Comedy!**\n\n\\*Joined by my other 
 social groups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out and night with 
 lots of laughter in store\n\n**Event Fee:**\n\nI will be in the front lobb
 y (look for me-Steve and the group)\nEarly Bird Price:\n**20 dollars in ad
 vance (e transfer or pay me cash any day prior to the day of the event)**\
 nDay of Event Price\n**25 dollars day of and/or when you arrive (HST is in
 cluded)**\nCash or through e transfer to:\nsteveflemming11@gmail.com\n\nMo
 re event details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer)\n\n*
 *Event Details:**\n\n**Thursday Night Comedy Show with Friends! (at Absolu
 te Comedy) (Yonge and Eglinton)**\n\n\\*A great night to mix\, mingle and 
 laugh the night away to some of the best comedians around!\n\n\\*Please ar
 rive between 7:30 pm and 8:00 pm for a little pre-show mingle which will b
 e a great way to get to know everyone before the show starts\n\n\\*You wil
 l see us in the front bar area of the venue when you first come in\n\n\\*P
 lenty of parking on Yonge street and in residential area\n\n\\*Walking dis
 tance (3-4 minutes) from the Yonge and Eglinton subway station\n\n\\*You w
 ill be expected to purchase minimum beverage and/or appetizer once inside 
 the comedy show to support the staff and comedians\n\\*Dinner menu is also
  provided as well\, so bring your appetite if you like :)\n\nThanks for re
 ading and signing up\; going to be a great night!
