SUMMARY:The Friday Night Mix\, Mingle\, Dinner and Live Music Party!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'd like to invite you out to our **Friday Night Mix\, MIngle\, Dinnner an
 d Live Music Party!**\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good conver
 sation and great food awaits!\n\n\\*Remember to ask for Steve when you arr
 ive-so they can point you to the group\n(you will be paying your fee to me
  not the person at the front door-much appreciated)\n\n*\\*Joined by my ot
 her social groups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date
 :** Friday\, September 25th 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 
 6:30 p.m. -8:00 p.m. (if you can)\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** Sm
 oke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential 
 area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt
 . Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Det
 ails Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent D
 etails:\n**The Friday Night Mix\, Mingle\, Dinner and Live Music Party!**\
 n\nStart your weekend with a fun Friday night of great conversation\, new 
 connections\, dinner\, drinks and live music at Smoke Show!\n\nThis is a r
 elaxed social night designed for people who enjoy meeting others without t
 he pressure of a formal singles event.\nCome on your own or bring a friend
  — we’ll have a friendly group ready to mix\, mingle and enjoy the eve
 ning together.\n\n🍽️ DINNER\, DRINKS & CONVERSATION\nWe’ll start th
 e evening by getting comfortable\, ordering some food and drinks\, and get
 ting to know one another. Don’t worry if you’re coming alone — many 
 people do! We’ll help introduce people and get the conversations flowing
 .\n🎵 LIVE MUSIC\nAs the evening gets going\, we’ll enjoy live music w
 hile continuing to mix and mingle. You can sit back and listen\, chat with
  new friends\, grab another drink\, or move around and meet more people.\n
 🤝 MEET NEW PEOPLE\nThe idea is simple: get out of the house\, put the p
 hones away for a while and enjoy some real face-to-face socializing. You n
 ever know who you might meet — a new friend\, someone to join you at fut
 ure events\, or perhaps someone special.\n\nNo pressure. No complicated ag
 enda. Just a fun Friday night with good food\, good music\, good conversat
 ion and good company.\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*Join us any time between 6:
 30 pm and 8:00 pm (if you can) for a fun and highly interactive evening as
  we get to know the members over dinner and great conversations (of your c
 hoice)\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only please) (HST included)\nor
  in advance by e transfer to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://stevefle
 mming11@gmail.com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Re
 minder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum to support the venue- this
  is greatly appreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
