SUMMARY:The Friday Night Disco Band and Dance Bash!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Get ready for a fun Friday night of mingling\, dancing\, live music and gr
 eat company at Smoke Show!\n\n\\*Remember to ask for Steve when you arrive
 -so they can point you to me and the group\n(you will be paying your fee t
 o me not the other person at the front door-much appreciated)\n\n*\\*Joine
 d by my other social groups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*
 \n\n**Date:** Friday\, September 25th 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Please arriv
 e between 8:30 p.m. -9:45 p.m. (if you can)\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Loca
 tion:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Re
 sidential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglin
 ton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\
 nEvent Details Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\
 n\nEvent Details:\n**The Friday Night Disco Band and Dance Bash!**\n\nIt
 ’s time to turn up the energy with a live band\, great music and plenty 
 of dancing!\n\nWhether you come on your own or bring a friend\, this is al
 l about having a relaxed\, social night where singles\, couples and friend
 s can meet\, talk\, laugh and enjoy the music together.\n\n💃 Dancing an
 d great music\n🎸 Live band\n🎧 DJ and dance music\n🍽️ Food and d
 rinks available for purchase\n🗣️ Plenty of time to mix and mingle\n
 😊 Friendly\, welcoming social atmosphere\n👋 Come solo or bring some 
 friends\n\nNo need to be a great dancer—just come ready to have some fun
 !\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*Join us any time between 8:30 pm and 9:45 pm (i
 f you can) for a fun and highly interactive evening as we get to know the 
 members over dinner and great conversations (of your choice)\n\n**Event Fe
 e:**\n10 dollars (cash only please) (HST included)\nor in advance by e tra
 nsfer to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)*
 *\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One be
 verage or appetizer minimum to support the venue- this is greatly apprecia
 ted :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
