SUMMARY:The Awesome Autumn Karaoke Bash! (Saturday\, September 26th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nGet ready to sing\, laugh and celebrate the season at **The Awesome Aut
 umn Karaoke Bash!** Whether you’re a confident performer\, a casual sing
 along fan or someone who simply enjoys great company\, come join us for a 
 lively night of music\, drinks and friendly conversation.\n\n\\*Joined by 
 my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with
  lots of friendly peers to enjoy karaoke with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at
  **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks nort
 h of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find
  us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to 
 show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Par
 king found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSince
 rely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Aweso
 me Autumn Karaoke Bash! (Saturday\, September 26th)**\n\n-Autumn is here\,
  and we’re celebrating with an entertaining evening of karaoke and new c
 onnections! Choose an old favourite\, try something unexpected or relax wi
 th a drink while cheering on the singers.\nYou don’t need a perfect voic
 e or any karaoke experience—this event is about having fun\, meeting fri
 endly people and enjoying the moment. Come alone\, bring a friend or invit
 e a group. We’ll help everyone feel welcome!\n**Evening highlights:**\n\
 n* Karaoke favourites from every decade\n* A relaxed and supportive atmosp
 here\n* Cocktails\, beer\, soft drinks and food available for purchase\n* 
 Opportunities to meet new people\n* Plenty of music\, laughter and autumn 
 fun\n* Two mics for duets as well :)\n\nPlease be respectful of the venue\
 , performers and fellow guests. Everyone is encouraged to participate\, bu
 t singing is always optional.\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City So
 cial Club**\n\n***\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only at the door) (H
 ST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n***\n\n**
 Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 7:30 pm (in the back area-
  great for board games\, card games and mingling) (event goes to roughly 1
 2:00 am)\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(Two beverag
 e or beverage and appetizer minimum to support the venue and this great ev
 ent)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on aven
 ue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantand
 firkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simp
 ly take bus or uber from the station)
